Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Remove=20card=20de=20"jornada"=20do=20Hist?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=B3rico=20de=20Movimenta=C3=A7=C3=B5es=20(redundante=20com?=
